  Cell["ModularTensorProductVectors[m, factors] gives every \
representation-valued channel of the model's fields times formal modular-form \
copies (all copies, paths and zeros) for TargetIrreps, with total actual \
weight kW.", "Usage"], Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], 
